"Evidence", "text": "“The authenticity of the Ring of Nestor has been debated, 
primarily focusing on its iconography and the possibility of forgery by the 
Gilliérons. New technical observations presented in this document support the 
ring's authenticity, countering previous arguments against it. The ring 
showcases unique stylistic and manufacturing details that align with known 
Minoan-Mycenaean artifacts, reinforcing its ancient origin.”", "source_ids": 
["20260627193302918954_7704a226"], "all_source_ids": 
